( F5 T4 U5a: control_mesh_extrude_element_group_new 6.184. Old groups 0
  and 1, then one new group per old group and interval of z 0 1 2:
  group 0 -> 5, -1 [dropped], group 1 -> 7, 8. Nodes left without an
  element are deleted. No control_timestep: the extrude runs at its own
  control index, as in the Professional other/extrude1. Mesh =
  Professional 02-08-2026. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
end_initia
node 1  0.0 0.0 0.0
node 2  1.0 0.0 0.0
node 3  2.0 0.0 0.0
node 4  0.0 1.0 0.0
node 5  1.0 1.0 0.0
node 6  2.0 1.0 0.0
element 1  -quad4  1 2 4 5
element 2  -tria3  2 3 5
element 3  -tria3  3 6 5
element_group 1 0
element_group 2 1
element_group 3 1
group_type -ra 0 1 -ra -materi
group_materi_elasti_young -ra 0 1 -ra 1000.
group_materi_elasti_poisson -ra 0 1 -ra 0.2
group_materi_density -ra 0 1 -ra 0.
control_mesh_extrude 10 0. 1. 2.
control_mesh_extrude_element_group_new 10 0 1  5 -1  7 8
end_data
